      "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>In <i><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\">Potion Maker</a></i> <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">upgrades</strong> can be purchased for coins. Upgrades increase the player's ability to create potions.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/a/ac/UpgradeMenu_Max.png/revision/latest?cb=20150531010635\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A fully upgraded menu.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/a/ac/UpgradeMenu_Max.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20150531010635\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"291\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"UpgradeMenu Max.png\" data-image-key=\"UpgradeMenu_Max.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:UpgradeMenu_Max.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">A fully upgraded menu.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_Upgrades\">List of Upgrades</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUpgrades%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Upgrade\n</th>\n<th>Effect\n</th>\n<th>Maximum Level\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Life Potion Materials\n</td>\n<td>Adds a new type of potion materials for life potions, allowing higher level potions to be created.\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mana Potion Materials\n</td>\n<td>Adds a new type of potion materials for mana potions, allowing higher level potions to be created.\n</td>\n<td>25\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stamina Potion Materials\n</td>\n<td>Adds a new type of potion materials for stamina potions, allowing higher level potions to be created.\n</td>\n<td>25\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Emission\n</td>\n<td>Increases the maximum output of materials on the top bar. This upgrade is not effective when choosing the initial material.\n</td>\n<td>20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Enhancement Success Rate\n</td>\n<td>Adds additional percentages to the enhancement success rate.\n</td>\n<td>&#43;10.345%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Selling Price\n</td>\n<td>Multiplies the selling price by the selected amount.\n</td>\n<td>&#43;20%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Upgrade Pushcat\n</td>\n<td>Increases <a href=\"/wiki/Pushcat\" title=\"Pushcat\">Pushcat</a> push rate.\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<table id=\"Stub\" class=\"noprint stub plainlinks\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><i>This article is a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Stub\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Wikipedia:Stub\">stub</a>. You can help Potion Maker Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://potionmaker.fandom.com/wiki/Upgrades?action=edit&amp;useeditor=source\">expanding it</a>.</i>\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261012200207\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor vi